Subject: [PATCH 18/19] test(motion): re-pin the seven IRAM G2 pure-motion
 sources in the source gate

The G2 placement (3fd8758) deliberately changes seven pinned pure-motion sources
(BodyPose.cpp, FootContact.cpp, Gait.cpp, ImuAttitude.cpp, LegKinematics.cpp,
TiltCompensation.cpp, TiltedContactIk.cpp). Reviewed: with the MATDOG_MOTION_HOT
attribute and the MotionHotPath.h include stripped, every changed source is
byte-identical to a86c680; MotionHotPath.h gains comment lines only.
ImuAttitude.cpp is added as an override of its PR-2 pin, as BodyPose.cpp was for
G1 (f349af9).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
